      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCOOTIN' SCOOBY (2) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a neck (30.85) behind CHERYL BLUE at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Makes plenty of appeal. MOLLY MISS (7) has been in sparkling form with a two start winning streak followed by a last start placing (34.71) at The Gardens. Form here at this distance is sound. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. SWIFT BREE (1) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 527m at this track, taking a NG in an exceptional 30.24. Should be in this for a long way. ARMATREE ASAFA (8) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to make amends.",
